{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y的音乐细节和情绪变化被压缩了不少，尤其缺少X中按音乐进程逐步展开的节奏、音色、力度及细微心理转折，听觉感受的颗粒度有所下降。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y更容易让普通观众在听音乐时跟住人物的心理过程：每段发生了什么、为什么产生这种反应、前一个念头怎样引出下一个念头，都有比较清楚的交代，左右分栏也让叙事和音乐感受各有位置。X的优势是音乐与情绪的细部对应更丰富，特别是标注到时出现的内容，能呈现更细腻的变化，但大量感受词连续出现，容易让观众忙于接收局部信息而忽略人物正在经历什么。整体而言，Y更容易形成一条完整、可信的心理故事，X则在具体听觉感受和瞬间情绪刻画上更有深度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd084d9c-0b0d-48df-a37f-423ea34073ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T181009353650Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.343, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T18:11:26.719876+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "138b1f2526fc67f4fc8e787c625edf02aa5ea057008be423b12c1c0e3118e7fe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222